# Node dependencies. The lockfile (web/package-lock.json) is committed instead, so
# installs are reproducible without carrying the tree itself.
node_modules/

# The built bundle IS committed on purpose: it lets a fresh clone run
# `docker compose up` and get a working UI with no npm step. See the "Tradeoffs and
# decisions" section of the README.
# web/dist/

